Mini App Opens
     │
     ▼
Telegram injects window.Telegram.WebApp.initData
     │
     ▼
Frontend sends: POST /api/auth/telegram
  body: { initData: "..." }
     │
     ▼
verifyTelegramInitData()
  → HMAC-SHA256 signature check
  → auth_date expiry check (24hr)
  → parse user object
     │
     ├── INVALID → 401 UNAUTHORIZED
     │
     ▼
prisma.user.upsert()
  → first visit → creates new user (BUYER role)
  → return visit → updates name/photo only
     │
     ▼
signToken({ userId, telegramId, role })
cache.set(`session:${userId}`, ..., 7days)
     │
     ▼
Returns: { token, user }